  "circulation_reference_plan": "calibration/circulation_audit_20261026/plan.json",
  "physical_definition": "Only sharededdy_rate,precip_tau_days,convective_rh vary within the declared bounded box, on environmental6K/km/no-mix/column-convection/7.5m/s baseline. Eddy changes heat as well as water. All other actual per-case parameters must match the environmentalcontrol exactly. Planet and geography are unchanged. Strict numerical/water/mass/layer/branch certificates and realistic speed bounds required; external thermalreference6must stillpass. No observed forcing added, humidity reset or regional multiplier. Bounds describe sensitivity ranges, not independently inferred physical confidence intervals.",
